{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西方樹名，亦名顛咀梨。角同皂莢，其味如梅，角寬一兩指，長三四寸，時人鎮食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即芭蕉子，以少胡椒粖安在果上，手極捼之，皆變成水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "狀如酸棗，其味一種，唯有此棗無甜者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其果大如李"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其果狀如蘡薁子，味亦相似"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是葡萄菓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形如小棗，甜而且澁，樹多獨立，形若椶櫚。此等諸漿，\n皆須淨洗手，淨濾漉，然後堪飲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此方無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楝木是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此方無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云毘首羯磨天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐言「能」也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣如《長阿笈摩戒蘊品》中說於菴婆娑婆羅門事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其伽他如餘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云淨金"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "少句，未見本"}
